3:T5ff,<h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Last Updated: January 16, 2026</strong></p><p>At OfficialUM1, we prioritize your privacy. This policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your data.</p><h2>1. Information We Collect</h2><ul><li><strong>Account Data:</strong> When you register, we collect your email address and password (encrypted).</li><li><strong>Guest Checkout:</strong> If you checkout as a guest, we store your email address solely for order delivery and linking to future accounts.</li><li><strong>Payment Data:</strong> We <strong>do not</strong> store your credit card details. All payments are processed securely by Stripe, Cryptomus, or Binance Pay.</li></ul><h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2><ul><li>To process and deliver your orders.</li><li>To communicate order updates via Email or Telegram (if provided).</li><li>To provide customer support and resolve disputes.</li></ul><h2>3. Data Protection</h2><p>We use industry-standard encryption (SSL) to protect your data during transmission. Your passwords are hashed and never stored in plain text.</p><h2>4. Cookies</h2><p>We use essential cookies to maintain your login session and shopping cart. We do not use third-party tracking cookies for advertising.</p><h2>5. Your Rights</h2><p>You have the right to request the deletion of your account and data at any time by contacting support. Note that order records may be retained for legal/accounting purposes.</p><h2>6. Contact Us</h2><p>For privacy concerns, contact us at <strong>hello@officialum1.com</strong>.</p>0:{"buildId":"osv-C2KLdYv-LmFABT7jm","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingTop":"120px","paddingBottom":"80px"},"children":["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}]}],["$","$L4",null,{}]]}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/f5df614824ac923e.js","async":true}]],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["